goats browsing on this plant', NULL, '[{"text":"Cardiac amino acids","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Cardiac glucose","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Cardiac glycerol","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Cardiac glycosides","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Correct Answer: (4) Cardiac glycosides

