(B) Molluscs

(C) Insects

(D) Crustaceans', NULL, '[{"text":"(A), (B), (C), (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A), (C), (B), (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (B), (A), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Explanation:

This sequence follows the correct order of invertebrates occurrence as per NCERT diagrams.

CUET Tip: Practice NCERT diagrams.

Invertebrates

