(C) research has demonstrated overwhelming evidence of', NULL, '[{"text":"(D), (B), (C), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (A), (B), (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A), (C), (D), (B)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (A), (D), (B)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'The coherent sentence formed :

Research has demonstrated overwhelming evidence of the role of sound sleep in memory consolidation and our ability to generate innovative solutions to complex problems while sleep disruption increases the level of stress hormone cortisol.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.085Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
