(B) although mobile phones have revolutionized

(C) communication, excessive usage can lead to

(D) various health issues, including eye strain, sleep', NULL, '[{"text":"(D), (A), (B), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (C), (D), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (A), (D), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'The coherent sentence formed is :

