A person who eats too much is a/an_', NULL, '[{"text":"glutton","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"epicure","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"gourmand","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"pagan","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'A glutton is a person who consumes excessively or habitually, especially of food and drink. The term often carries a negative connotation, implying greed or overindulgence.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.088Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
