What are you trying to ''insinuate'' through this message?', NULL, '[{"text":"Express","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Affirm","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Allude","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Propagate","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'To insinuate means to suggest or hint at something bad or derogatory in an indirect and unpleasant way.

