A careful ''preservation and protection'' of the flora and fauna is the need of the hour.', NULL, '[{"text":"Conservation","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Promotion","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Enhancement","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Management","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'The single word that means the careful preservation and protection of natural resources, including flora and fauna, is Conservation. (Note: Option 1 is spelled as ''Conservation'', but it clearly refers to ''Conservation'').', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.093Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
