The oppressive regime continued to _ anyone who spoke out against its injustices.', NULL, '[{"text":"prosecute","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"perpetuate","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"persecute","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"provoke","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'The sentence describes an oppressive regime''s actions against people who spoke out against injustices.

