Given her fearful and timid nature in unfamiliar situations, we can say that she is _', NULL, '[{"text":"audacious","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"timorous","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"reckless","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"intrepid","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'The sentence describes a fearful and timid nature in unfamiliar situations.

- Timorous means showing or suffering from nervousness, fear, or a lack of confidence; timid.

- Audacious and intrepid mean brave/fearless. Reckless means without thought for danger.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.094Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
