(B) digestion is an intricate process that begins in the mouth

(C) where food is broken down mechanically and chemically

(D) and continues in the stomach and intestines', NULL, '[{"text":"(B), (C). (A). (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B). (D). (C). (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (A). (C). (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C). (B). (A). (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Digestion is an intricate process that begins in the mouth where food is broken down mechanically and chemically and continues in the stomach and intestines into simpler molecules that can be absorbed into the bloodstream. (BCDA should be the correct sequence)', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.099Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
