The company''s growth was _ by the adverse change in the market regulations.', NULL, '[{"text":"augmented","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"facilitated","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"propelled","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"hindered","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Hindered : obstructed or slowed growth; fits negative impact of regulation.

Why not others:

Augmented : increased, opposite meaning.

Facilitated : made easier, incorrect.

Propelled : pushed forward, positive effect, unsuitable.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.120Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (393, 1, NULL, NULL, 'Rearrange the following parts to make a meaningful sentence:

(A) role in scavenging dead organic materials and diseased

(B) population as well as aquatic plants and weeds

(C) according to environmentalists, the turtle plays a significant

(D) fish in the river, thereby controlling the fish', NULL, '[{"text":"(B), (D), (A), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A), (B), (C), (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (A), (D), (B)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'According to environmentalists, the turtle plays a significant role in scavenging dead organic materials and diseased fish in the river; thereby controlling the fish population as well as aquatic plants and weeds.

(C) provides the subject and reporting frame.

(A) states the "significant role" the turtle plays.

(D) adds the consequence "thereby controlling ...."

(B) concludes by describing the broader impact on "fish population as well as aquatic plants and weeds."', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.120Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
