Sporadic', NULL, '[{"text":"Irregular","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Consistent","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Confident","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Obscure","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'Irregular : occurring at uneven or unpredictable intervals; synonym of sporadic.

Why not others:

Consistent : opposite meaning.

