The _ rumble of the thunder hinted at the approaching danger, filling the air with a sense of unease.', NULL, '[{"text":"pretentious","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"contentious","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"tenuous","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"portentous","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Portentous: signaling or warning of something significant/threatening; fits the ominous thunder.

