B: callus (thickened skin)

C: denotes (indicates explicitly)

D: callous (insensitive or unfeeling)', NULL, NULL, 2025, '/local-papers/assets/english-2025-05-20-shift-2/q34-table-1.jpg', 'Table for question 34', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.122Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/english-2025-05-20-shift-2/q34-table-1.jpg","alt":"Table for question 34","kind":"table"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (399, 1, NULL, NULL, 'Select the word closest in meaning to the word Narcissism-', NULL, '[{"text":"Meanness","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Self-love","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Modesty","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Magnanimity","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Self-love : extreme admiration or interest in oneself; synonym of narcissism.

Why not others:

