(B) Areal Differentiation

(C) Regional Analysis

(D) Exploration and Description', NULL, '[{"text":"(A), (B), (C), (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (C), (B), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (A), (D), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Table 1.1 of the aforementioned chapter mentions all these time periods and their focus elaborately.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.248Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (571, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Cities, such as Ghaziabad, Rohtak, Gurugram, located in proximity to the Metropolitan city of Delhi are also known as :', NULL, '[{"text":"Functional towns","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Administrative towns","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Commercial towns","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Satellite towns","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Some old towns developed as satellite towns around metropolitan cities like Ghaziabad, Rohtak, Gurugram in proximity to Delhi.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.249Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (572, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Arrange the following states of India in descending order according to their total population.

(A) Rajasthan

(B) Arunachal Pradesh

(C) Sikkim

(D) Uttar Pradesh', NULL, '[{"text":"(D), (B), (C), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (A), (B), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (A), (C), (B)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A), (D), (B), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Uttar Pradesh has the highest population, followed by Rajasthan and Arunanchal Pradesh, whereas Sikkim has the lowest. Arunanchal Pradesh has the lowest population "density" (17 persons per sq km) and the actual population is higher than that of Sikkim.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.249Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (573, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Which of the following regions is NOT associated with mediterranean agriculture?', NULL, '[{"text":"Southern California","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"North Western Europe","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Central Chile","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"South Western parts of Australia","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, '1. Regions Where Mediterranean Agriculture is Practised include

Countries on either side of the Mediterranean Sea in Europe and in North Africa (from Tunisia to the Atlantic coast), Southern California, Central Chile, South western parts of South Africa, South and south western parts of Australia.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.250Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (574, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Match List-I with List-II', NULL, '[{"text":"(A) - (1), (B) - (II), (C) - (III), (D) - (IV)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A) - (1), (B) - (III), (C) - (II), (D) - (IV)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A) - (I), (B) - (II), (C) - (IV), (D) - (III)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A) - (III), (B) - (IV), (C) - (I), (D) - (II)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'See map (figure) 5.5 : India - Conventional Energy Resources as

• (A) Singarauli → (III) Madhya Pradesh

• (B) Singareni → (IV) Andhra Pradesh (Singareni Collieries are mainly in Telangana/earlier Andhra Pradesh)

(C) Neyveli $ \rightarrow $ (I) Tamil Nadu

(D) Jharia $ \rightarrow $ (II) Jharkhand', NULL, NULL, 2025, '/local-papers/assets/geography-2025-05-20-shift-1/q10-table-1.jpg', 'Table for question 10', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.250Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/geography-2025-05-20-shift-1/q10-table-1.jpg","alt":"Table for question 10","kind":"table"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (575, 13, NULL, NULL, 'The Census of India, 1991, defines urban settlements as all places which have the following:

(A) Have a minimum population of 5000 persons

(B) At least 75 percent of male workers are engaged in non-agricultural pursuits

(C) People derive their life support from land-based economic activities

(D) Density of population is at least 400 persons per square kilometer', NULL, '[{"text":"(A), (B) and (D) only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A), (B) and (C) only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A), (C) and (D) only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (C) and (D) only","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, '1. Definition of Urban Settlements (Census of India, 1991):

a. The place must have a municipality, corporation, cantonment board, or a notified town area committee.

b. A minimum population of 5,000 persons is required.

c. At least 75 per cent of the male workers must be engaged in non-agricultural pursuits.

d. There must be a density of population of at least 400 persons per square kilometer.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.251Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (576, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Which of the following causes land degradation ?', NULL, '[{"text":"Rotation of crops","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Afforestation","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Dumping of Industrial waste","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Applying organic manure","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'There are some other types of wastelands such as degraded shifting cultivation area, degraded land under plantation crops, degraded forests, degraded pastures, and mining and industrial wastelands, are caused by human action.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.251Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (577, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Identify the odd one on the basis of the scale of communication?', NULL, '[{"text":"Television","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Radio","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Letters","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Cinema","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Letters come under Personal Communication whereas others come under Mass communication.', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.252Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (578, 13, NULL, NULL, 'Long staple (American) cotton grown in north-western parts of India is called _.', NULL, '[{"text":"Bitty cotton","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Indian cotton","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Narma","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Golden Fibre","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'India grows both short staple (Indian) cotton as well as long staple (American) cotton called ''narma'' in north-western parts of the country.

