(D) Vedic traditions', NULL, '[{"text":"(A), (B), (C), (D)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (B), (C), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (A), (D), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'The correct sequence is 2. (D),(B),(C),(A) because :

