(B) Early Upanishads - c. sixth century BCE

(C) First stupas - c. third century BCE

(A) Earliest temples - c. third century CE', NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:38.339Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
