Match List-I with List-II', NULL, '[{"text":"(A) - $ (\\mathrm{III}) $, (B) - $ (\\mathrm{II}) $, (C) - $ (\\mathrm{I}) $, (D) - $ (\\mathrm{IV}) $","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A) - $ (\\mathrm{I}\\mathrm{II}) $, (B) - $ (\\mathrm{I}) $, (C) - $ (\\mathrm{II}) $, (D) - $ (\\mathrm{IV}) $","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A) - $ (\\mathrm{II}) $, (B) - $ (\\mathrm{III}) $, (C) - $ (\\mathrm{I}) $, (D) - $ (\\mathrm{IV}) $","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(A) - $ (\\mathrm{I}\\mathrm{II}) $, (B) - $ (\\mathrm{I}) $, (C) - $ (\\mathrm{IV}) $, (D) - $ (\\mathrm{II}) $","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Since Sum of all probabilities is 1:

$$ 0.2+k+k+2k+k=1 $$

