Therefore, the correct answer is ''Option 4''.', NULL, NULL, 2024, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:46.232Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
