To give a book a _ reading is to skim it quickly without comprehending much.', NULL, '[{"text":"cursory","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"cryptic","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"morose","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"munificent","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'The correct answer is ''cursory''.
