Kalyani made her children _ chores on Sunday.', NULL, '[{"text":"make some","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"take some","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"do some","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"does some","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'The correct answer is ''do some''.
