Tamil Nadu excels in sports like chess, athletics, and table tennis.

o The state has a robust sports culture and encourages youth participation in various sports activities.', NULL, NULL, 2024, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:46.321Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
