The pollen tube enters the embryo sac through:', NULL, '[{"text":"chalazal end","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"laterally","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"antipodals","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"micropylar end","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2023, '/local-papers/assets/biology-2023-06-01-shift-3/q42-figure-1.jpg', 'Figure for question 42', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T20:59:54.649Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/biology-2023-06-01-shift-3/q42-figure-1.jpg","alt":"Figure for question 42","kind":"figure"}]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
