B. Malachite $ \rightarrow $ CuCO $ _{3} $.Cu(OH) $ _{2} $

C. Cuprite, soft, heavy, red oxide mineral ( $ Cu_{2}O $) that is an important ore of copper

D. Copper glance is the principal sulfide ore of copper. Its chemical name is Copper(I) sulfide and its chemical formula is $ Cu_{2}S $.', NULL, NULL, 2023, '/local-papers/assets/chemistry-2023-06-07-shift-3/q22-table-1.jpg', 'Table for question 22', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:05.158Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/chemistry-2023-06-07-shift-3/q22-table-1.jpg","alt":"Table for question 22","kind":"table"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (2400, 5, NULL, NULL, 'Match List - I with List - II.

