XeF_{6} + H_{2}O → ? HF', NULL, '[{"text":"XeOF_{4}","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"XeO_{2}F_{2}","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"xeO_{3}","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Xe","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'The complete hydrolysis of XeF₆ produces XeO₃ which is xenon trioxide.

