''tap il pue" means Life is hard

''pue'' tiw il'' means hard is nothing

''tap zeu ylu'' means Enjoy your life

Which code could mean ''life is nothing'' in that Artificial language?', NULL, '[{"text":"zeu tap il","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"pue tap ylu","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"ylu tap tiw","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"tap tiw il","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'tap → life

tiw → nothing

il/pue → is/hard

From the given information it is not possible to find the correct code of ''is'' and ''hard''. So, code of ''life is nothing'' could be ''tap tiw il'' or ''tap tiw pue''. But in options ''tap tiw pue'' is not given so option (d) is correct answer.', NULL, NULL, 2023, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:05.971Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
