Which code could mean "Save Drink"?', NULL, '[{"text":"Botlo ajebo","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Botlo pono","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Pono ajebo","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Maroh Botlo","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'Botlo → Drink

Pono → Water

Maroh → Chew

Ajebo - Save

Therefore, code for ''Save Drink'' would be ''Botlo Ajebo''.', NULL, NULL, 2023, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:06.015Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
