nto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se en meistern was","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'For protoplast fusion, the two cells of desired plants are first treated with enzymes pectinase and cellulase. These enzymes dissolve the cell wall and as a result naked protoplasts are produced.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.093Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3667, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Arrange the following options in a sequential manner to demonstrate degradation caused by improper resource utilisation and maintenance.

A. Barren patches of land that become large and lead to desertification

B. Fertile top soil can be removed easily by over cultivation

C. Deposition of thin crust of salt on land surface

D. Unrestricted grazing of animals

E. Irrigation without proper drainage of water leading to water logging in the soil', NULL, '[{"text":"A, B, C, D, E","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"C, D, A, B, E","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"B, D, E, C, A","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"E, D, B, C, A","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'The fertile top-soil can be removed very easily due to human activities like over-cultivation, unrestricted grazing, deforestation and poor irrigation practices, resulting in arid patches of land.

When large barren patches extend and meet over time, a desert is created. Hence, option C is correct.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.097Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3668, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Match List I with List II', NULL, '[{"text":"A-IV, B-I, C-II, D-III","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A-III, B-IV, C-I, D-II","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A-1, B-II, C-IV, D-III","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A-II, B-III, C-I, D-IV","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Fertilization (fusion of egg and sperm) takes place at ampulla of the female reproductive tract. Fimbriae are finger-like projections on the ends of your fallopian tubes closest to your ovaries. The clitoris is part of the vulva, the name for the external parts of female genitalia.', NULL, NULL, 2022, '/local-papers/assets/biology-2022-08-20/q02-table-1.jpg', 'Table for question 2', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.098Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/biology-2022-08-20/q02-table-1.jpg","alt":"Table for question 2","kind":"table"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3669, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Mucosa associated lymphoid tissue constitutes', NULL, '[{"text":"10%","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"20%","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"40%","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"50%","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Mucosa-associated lymphoid tissue (MALT) are lymphoid tissues found in various submucosal membrane sites of the body, such as the gastrointestinal tract, oral passage, nasopharyngeal tract, thyroid, breast, lung, salivary glands, eye, and skin. MALT constitutes about 50% of the lymphoid tissue in the human body.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.098Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3670, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Which of the following is INCORRECT statement?

A. In IUD''s, released Cu ions increases sperm motility and fertilising capacity of sperms

B. Multiload 375 is medicated IUD

C. Lippes loop is non-medicated IUD

D. LNG-20 is hormones releasing IUD

E. Vault is an IUD.', NULL, '[{"text":"A & E only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A & B only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"B & D only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"B & C only","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'Two are incorrect statement:

i. Copper releasing IUDs decrease sperm motility and fertilising capacity of sperm.

ii. Vault is a barrier method of contraception.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.099Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3671, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Which of the following is not a vegetation propagation?', NULL, '[{"text":"Runner of grass","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Offset of water hyacinth","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Rhizome of Ginger","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Bud of Hydra","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'In plants, the units of vegetative propagation are runner, rhizome, sucker, tuber, offset, bulb etc. They are capable of giving rise to new offspring.

Buds in Hydra are asexual reproductive structures. They are do not involved in vegetative propagation.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.100Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3672, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Select the correct sequence of development of following stages in a primary succession

A. Scrub Stage

B. Marsh-meadow stage

C. Submerged free floating plant stage

D. Reed-swamp stage

E. Submerged plant stage', NULL, '[{"text":"C, E, B, D, A","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"E, C, D, B, A","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"D, E, B, C, A","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"E, C, D, A, B","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'The primary succession in water involved following step: the pioneers are replaced with time by rooted-submerged plants, rooted-floating angiosperms followed by free-floating plants, then reed-swamp, marsh-meadow, scrub and finally the trees.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.100Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3673, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Which of the following process involves the theory of antigen-antibody interaction?', NULL, '[{"text":"PCR","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"ELISA","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Gene Therapy","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Gel electrophoresis","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'The most common application of antigen-antibody reactions is in diagnostics using an enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay (ELISA).', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.101Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3674, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Following are the animals that recently became extinct, except', NULL, '[{"text":"Dodo","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Quagga","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Thylacine","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Clarias garipinus","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Examples of recent extinctions of species include the dodo from Mauritius, quagga from Africa, thylacine from Australia and Steller''s Sea Cow from Russia whereas Clarias garipinus is not extinct till now.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.101Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3675, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Given below are two statements

Statement 1: Baculoviruses belonging to genus Nucleopolyhedrovirus are used as biological control agent.

Statement 2: These viruses are used as they are species-specific and have narrow spectrum insecticidal applications, so can be a good insecticide.

In the light of above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below', NULL, '[{"text":"Both statement 1 and statement 2 are correct","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Both statement 1 and statement 2 are incorrect","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Statement 1 is correct and statement 2 is incorrect","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Statement 1 is incorrect and statement 2 is correct","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'Both the statements are correct.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.102Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3676, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Complete the analogy

Migration Siberian Cranes :: Bear', NULL, '[{"text":"Regulation","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Hibernation","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Aestivation","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Diapause","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Hibernation is the state of an organism to conserve energy and the metabolic functions of the body slows down.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.102Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3677, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Development of analogous structure or organs are a result of _', NULL, '[{"text":"Divergent evolution","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Convergent evolution","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Adaptive radiation","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Saltation","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Analogous structures develop due to convergent evolution where in organisms belonging to different species are exposed to the same environmental conditions and they adapt similarly.

ovt as tu8 : tostoo su noitgo novig sdi to onon :oM', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.103Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3678, 6, NULL, NULL, 'The treatment of the bacterial cell with divalent cations leads to', NULL, '[{"text":"Increase in hydrophilic nature of DNA molecule","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Decreases efficiency with which DNA enters the bacterium","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Change in permeability of cell wall","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Increased efficiency with which DNA enters the bacterium","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'When the cell is treated with a specific solution of divalent cation calcium, it increases the efficiency of the cell to take up the foreign DNA through the pores in the cell wall. DNA is a hydrophilic molecule; it cannot pass through cell membranes. In order to force bacteria to take up the plasmid, the bacterial cells are first made ''competent'' to take up DNA.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.103Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3679, 6, NULL, NULL, 'A person complaining of stomach ache, weakness and sustained high fever was recommended Widal test by the doctor. Identify the pathogen responsible for the disease the person is suffering from:', NULL, '[{"text":"Streptococcus pneumonia","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Rhino Virus","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Salmonella typhi","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Plasmodium vivax","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Widal test is used to diagnose typhoid. In this case, the person is suffering from typhoid which is caused by Salmonella Typhi bacteria.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.103Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3680, 6, NULL, NULL, 'If 100 deaths take place in a population of 10,00,000 per year, then the death rate will be', NULL, '[{"text":"0.001 per person per year","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"0.0001 per person per year","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"0.1 per person per year","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"1 per person per year","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'The death rate

=(Number of deaths per year / Total population)

= $ \frac{100}{10,00,000} $

= $ \frac{1}{10000} $

=0.0001 per person per year', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.104Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3681, 6, NULL, NULL, 'The genetic variation shown by medicinal plant Rauwolfia vomitoria growing in Himalayan ranges, is an example of', NULL, '[{"text":"Ecosystem Diversity","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Ecological Diversity","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Species Diversity","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Genetic Diversity","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'The diversity shown by the medicinal plant Rauwolfia vomitoria growing in different Himalayan ranges is an example of genetic diversity.

The diversity at the ecosystem level is called ecological diversity.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.104Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3682, 6, NULL, NULL, 'Prime contaminant of lake for eutrophication is', NULL, '[{"text":"Dissolved oxygen","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Algal bloom","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Nitrate and phosphate","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Fungi and Bacteria","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Eutrophication is when the availability of nutrients increases excessively, the growth of algae starts. This excessive alga can take up the whole oxygen in the water and thus the aquatic animals start to get deprived of oxygen. The nitrates from nitrogen and phosphates from phosphorus are when washed away from the fields, they get mixed with lakes and rivers causing eutrophication there.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.105Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3683, 6, NULL, NULL, 'In Verhulst Pearl logistic growth curve equation, $ \frac{\mathrm{d}N}{\mathrm{d}t} = rN\left(\frac{K-N}{K}\right) $, ''r'' refers to:', NULL, '[{"text":"Population density at time t","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Population density at time Zero","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Intrinsic rate of natural increase","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Carrying capacity","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Verhulst-Pearl Logistic Growth curve equation is,

$ \frac{\mathrm{d}N}{\mathrm{d}t} = rN\left(\frac{K-N}{K}\right), $

where

N = Population density at time t

r = Intrinsic rate of natural increase

K = carrying capacity.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.105Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3684, 6, NULL, NULL, 'In the life cycle of Plasmodium, the gametocytes develop in', NULL, '[{"text":"WBC of human host","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"RBC of human host","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Gut of mosquito","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Saliva of anopheles mosquito","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Sexual stage (gametocyte) of Plasmodium occurs in human RBC.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.105Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
