Choose the correct answer form the options given below:', NULL, '[{"text":"A-1, B-III, C-IV, D-11","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A-Ⅱ, B-VI, C-I, D-III","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A-11, B-III, C-I, D-II","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A-IV, B-III, C-I, D-II","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Disease resistance varieties of following crops are -

