(a) Methoxybenzene

(b) Benzyl p-nitro phenyl ether

(c) tert-Butyl methyl ether

(d) Di-tert-Butyl ether

The IUPAC name of the ether

$ \mathrm{CH}_{2}=\mathrm{CH}-\mathrm{CH}_{2}-\mathrm{O}-\mathrm{CH}_{3} $', NULL, '[{"text":"Alkyl methyl ether","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"1-Methoxyprop-2-ene","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"3-Methoxyprop-1-ene","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Vinyl dimethyl ether","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'Williamson''s synthesis:

$$ \mathrm{R}-\mathrm{X}+\mathrm{R}^{\prime}\mathrm{ONa}\xrightarrow{\quad\Delta\quad}\mathrm{ROR}^{\prime}+\mathrm{NaX} $$

3°-alkyl Halide not form ether actually they undergo elimination reaction.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.221Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
