Select distinct Mqualification from Mother;', NULL, '[{"text":"It will display the mqualification column after filtering it","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"It will display each mqualification number of times","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"It will display each mqualification once after removing the duplicates","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"It will give error message","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Select distinct Mqualification from Mother; in the given query distinct is used to remove duplicates from column name Mqualification So, it will only display unique values and remove duplicates.

