Choose the correct answer the options given below:', NULL, '[{"text":"D, C, A, C","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"B, A, D, C","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A, C, B, D","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A, B, C, D","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.385Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
