Step 2: Let''s see which option/options has/have A matching with I. It''s only one b. Hence the answer is b.', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.392Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
