Which of the region represents doctors who are players as well as singers too?', NULL, '[{"text":"A","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"B","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"C","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"D","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Hence, C represents doctors, who are players as well as singers.', NULL, NULL, 2022, '/local-papers/assets/general-test-2022-08-06/q50-figure-1.jpg', 'Figure for question 50', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.486Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/general-test-2022-08-06/q50-figure-1.jpg","alt":"Figure for question 50","kind":"figure"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
