So, total number of rectangles = $ 1^{3} + 2^{3} + 3^{3} + 4^{3} + 5^{3} = 225 $', NULL, NULL, 2022, '/local-papers/assets/general-test-2022-08-08-shift-1/q17-figure-1.jpg', 'Figure for question 17', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:17.514Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/general-test-2022-08-08-shift-1/q17-figure-1.jpg","alt":"Figure for question 17","kind":"figure"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
