(c) A-I, B-II, C-III, D-IV

(d) A-IV, B-I, C-II, D-III

Gauss law in magnetism signifies that', NULL, '[{"text":"Magnetic lines of force can pass through a closed surface","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Net flux through closed surface is zero, monopole does not exist","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Net flux is always $\\mu_{0}$ times the net charge enclosed","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"There always exist a monopole","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Dr. Meghnand Saha''s vision was behind the project of cyclotron in India.', NULL, NULL, 2022, '/local-papers/assets/physics-2022-08-06/q09-table-1.jpg', 'Table for question 9', NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:28.954Z', NULL, NULL, '[{"url":"/local-papers/assets/physics-2022-08-06/q09-table-1.jpg","alt":"Table for question 9","kind":"table"}]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (4926, 4, NULL, NULL, 'A. At the magnetic pole of earth; angle of dip is $ 90^{\circ} $ and $ B_{H}=0 $.

B. At the magnetic pole of earth; angle of dip is zero and $ B_{v}=0 $.

C. At the magnetic equator of the earth; angle of dip is $ 90^{\circ} $ and $ B_{H}=0 $.

D. At the magnetic equator of the earth; angle of dip is zero and $ B_{v}=0 $.', NULL, '[{"text":"A and B only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"B and D only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"C and D only","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A and D only","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, 'At equator, the magnetic field lines become parallel to surface to earth.

So, angle of dip = 0

and, $B_{H}=B_{net}, B_{V}=0$

At pole, the magnetic field lines become perpendicular to surface of earth.

So, angle of dip = $90^{\circ}$

and, $B_{H}=0$, $B_{V}=B_{net}$', NULL, NULL, 2022, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:28.955Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
