$ v(t) = 2t\hat{i} + t^{2}\hat{j} $. The force acting on it, at time t = 2 s is given by', NULL, '[{"text":"$ (4\\hat{i} + 4\\hat{j})N $","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"$ (2\\hat{i} + 2\\hat{j})N $","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"$ (4\\hat{i} + 2\\hat{j})N $","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"$ (4\\hat{i} + 8\\hat{j})N $","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2021, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:29.048Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
