2. An instrument that records heart/beat action.', NULL, '[{"text":"Numismatics, Stethoscope","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Graphology, Cardiograph","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Ventriloquism, Cardiograph","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Graphology, Stethoscope","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, 'Step 1: Identify the term related to handwriting analysis.

