The actress wore a dark ___ to hide her face, but she could not suppress a loud ___ of grief when she saw the ___ state of the slum.', NULL, '[{"text":"vail, wail, vile","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"veil, vail, vile","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"veil, wail, vile","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"vile, wail, veil","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, 'Step 1: Fill the first blank.

