The ___ pupils were berated by the teacher for disturbing the other classes.', NULL, '[{"text":"Ruminative","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Rambunctious","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Docile","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Absconding","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, '### Step 1: Understanding the Question:

