Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', NULL, '[{"text":"3,2,1,4","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"3, 1, 2, 4","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"2, 3, 1, 4","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"3, 2, 4, 1","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, 'Concept:

