Quick Tip: Gathering and hunting are considered the oldest human economic activities in geography.', NULL, NULL, 2026, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:37.791Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
