London has historically functioned as an important entrepot trading port.

 $ \Rightarrow $ Entrepot Port

#### Step 3: Analyze Rotterdam.

Rotterdam is one of the world''s major re-export and transit ports.

 $ \Rightarrow $ Entrepot Port

### Step 4: Identify the correct option.

Since all the listed ports are entrepot ports:

All of the above

