 $$ =2+3 $$ 

Final Answer:

Quick Tip: Dot product:

 $$ \vec{a}\cdot\vec{b}=a_{x}b_{x}+a_{y}b_{y}+a_{z}b_{z} $$ 

Multiply corresponding components and add.', NULL, NULL, 2026, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:46.931Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
