1. Amount of Discount on issue of Debentures cannot be debited into Loss on issue of Debentures Account.

2. Amount of Discount on issue of Debentures can be debited into Loss on issue of Debentures Account.

3. Amount of Premium on Redemption of Debentures can be debited into Discount on issue of Debentures Account.

4. Amount of Discount on issue of Debentures can be debited into Premium on Redemption of Debentures Account.', NULL, '[{"text":"Amount of Discount on issue of Debentures cannot be debited into Loss on issue of Debentures Account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Amount of Discount on issue of Debentures can be debited into Loss on issue of Debentures Account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Amount of Premium on Redemption of Debentures can be debited into Discount on issue of Debentures Account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Amount of Discount on issue of Debentures can be debited into Premium on Redemption of Debentures Account","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:59.637Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
