3. A partner took a recorded liability, it will be shown the credit side of realization account

4. A partner took an un-recorded liability, it will be shown the credit side of realization account.', NULL, '[{"text":"A partner took an un-recorded asset, it will be shown the credit side of realization account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A partner takes an un-recorded asset, it will be shown the credit side of partners'' capital account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A partner took a recorded liability, it will be shown the credit side of realization account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"A partner took an un-recorded liability, it will be shown the credit side of realization account","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:59.655Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
