2024: Rs. 80,000

2023: Rs. 1,40,000,

2022: Rs. 2,000,000

2021: Rs. 1,60,000

The goodwill of the reconstituted firm will be', NULL, '[{"text":"Rs. 1,45,000","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Rs. 4,33,000","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Rs. 4,35,000","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Rs. 1,35,000","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:59.656Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
