2. Goodwill is the capitalized value attached to the differential profit capacity of a business.

3. Goodwill can exist when the firm does not earn super profits, means any firm that earns normal profits or is incurring losses has goodwill

4. Goodwill is an intangible asset.', NULL, '[{"text":"Goodwill is the value of the reputation of a firm in respect of the profits expected in future, over and above the normal profits","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Goodwill is the capitalized value attached to the differential profit capacity of a business","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Goodwill can exist when the firm does not earn super profits, means any firm that earns normal profits or is incurring losses has goodwill","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Goodwill is an intangible asset","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:59.656Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
