2. The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Debit Side of the Realisation Account.

3. The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Credit Side of the Bank Account.

4. The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Credit Side of the Capital Account.', NULL, '[{"text":"The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Credit Side of the Realisation Account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Debit Side of the Realisation Account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Credit Side of the Bank Account","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"The amount of Provision for Debtors is transferred to the Credit Side of the Capital Account","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2025, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:00:59.668Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
