(D) Death of a close family member

## (E) Change in eating habits

Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', NULL, '[{"text":"(D), (A), (C), (B), (E)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (C), (A), (B), (E)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(D), (B), (A), (C), (E)","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"(B), (D), (A), (E), (C)","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2024, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:01:00.282Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO questions ("id", "subject_id", "topic_id", "passage_id", "text", "text_hi", "options", "options_hi", "correct_option", "explanation", "explanation_hi", "difficulty", "year", "image_url", "image_alt", "explanation_image_url", "explanation_image_alt", "status", "supersedes_id", "created_by", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "assets_json", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (7451, 15, NULL, NULL, 'Which one is not a characteristic of crowding experience?', NULL, '[{"text":"Loss in privacy","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"loss of control over social interaction","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Negative view of the space around the person","image_url":null,"alt":null},{"text":"Feeling of comfort","image_url":null,"alt":null}]', NULL, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2024, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'published', NULL, NULL, '2026-11-05T21:01:00.282Z', NULL, NULL, '[]', 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
