Who inflicted severe defeats on the Sultan of Bijapur (1520)?

1. Rama Raya

2. Krishnadeva Raya

3. Harihara', NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_passages ("id", "paper_slug", "passage_key", "title", "body", "deleted_at") VALUES (102, 'history-2025-06-03-shift-2', 'p603dbe8387d5', 'Reading passage', 'Vijayanagara Empire

