HTML (HyperText Markup Language) is the standard language used to create and design web pages.

It defines the structure of a webpage using elements like headings, paragraphs, links, images, and tables.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[14]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.536Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
