Though Sharon complained and cried bitterly, Mom did not on her.', '[{"id":"A","text":"let in"},{"id":"B","text":"let off"},{"id":"C","text":"let out"},{"id":"D","text":"let up"}]', 0, 'D', 'The phrasal verb let up means to lessen or stop, or to relax one''s effort or pressure. The sentence means Mom did not ease the pressure despite the crying.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[54]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.544Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
