(A) and strengthens economic self-reliance

(B) manufacturing, creates jobs, encourages

(C) make in India promotes local

(D) innovation, attracts global investments', '[{"id":"A","text":"(D), (C), (B), (A)"},{"id":"B","text":"(A), (D), (C), (B)"},{"id":"C","text":"(B), (A), (D), (C)"},{"id":"D","text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)"}]', 0, 'D', 'Make in India promotes local manufacturing, creates jobs, encourages innovation, attracts global investments, and enhances economic self-reliance.

C-B : introduces the subject (Make in India) and main idea (promotes local manufacturing, creates jobs).

D: lists related outcomes (encourages innovation, attracts global investments).

A: concludes with ultimate goal (enhance economic self-reliance).', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[28]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.605Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (382, 'english-2025-05-20-shift-2', 'q18', 18, 18, 'Choose the most appropriate antonym for ''Vitiate'' from the options given below:-', '[{"id":"A","text":"Debase"},{"id":"B","text":"Activate"},{"id":"C","text":"Avenue"},{"id":"D","text":"Offend"}]', 0, 'B', 'Activate: to make something start or function; opposite of vitiate (spoil/weaken).

Why not others:

Debase : similar to vitiate, not opposite.

Avenge : revenge, unrelated.

Offend: hurt feelings, unrelated.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[29]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.605Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (383, 'english-2025-05-20-shift-2', 'q19', 19, 19, 'Rearrange the parts to form a meaningful sentence:

(A) proportions, due to the adoption of urban

(B) vitamin D deficiency, driven to an epidemic

(C) as stress fractures and neurological issues

(D) lifestyles result in severe symptoms, such', '[{"id":"A","text":"(C), (B), (A), (D)"},{"id":"B","text":"(B), (A), (C), (D)"},{"id":"C","text":"(B), (A), (D), (C)"},{"id":"D","text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)"}]', 0, 'C', 'Vitamin D deficiency, driven to an epidemic proportions due to the adoption of urban lifestyles, result in severe symptoms, such as stress fractures and neurological issues.

