Explicable: can be explained.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[30]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.610Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (385, 'english-2025-05-20-shift-2', 'q21', 21, 21, 'Select the appropriate word from the given options to complete the following sentence:-

The artist struggled with _ the perfect shade of blue for the sky on his palette.', '[{"id":"A","text":"affecting"},{"id":"B","text":"creating"},{"id":"C","text":"adjusting"},{"id":"D","text":"extracting"}]', 0, 'B', 'Adjusting: fine-tuning existing colors to achieve the desired shade.

Why not others:

Extracting : removing/obtaining, unrelated.

Creating: making new, not refining.

Affecting : influencing, not relevant.

Note: Confusing with creating, but context implies modifying, not making from scratch.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[31]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.610Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (386, 'english-2025-05-20-shift-2', 'q22', 22, 22, 'Rearrange the following parts into a meaningful sentence:

(A) share a common broad template, there are

(B) someone is prone to certain diseases, or has a particular hair colour

(C) although most of the letters in our DNA are identical, and

(D) also a lot of person-specific changes in them, due to which', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A), (D), (C), (B)"},{"id":"B","text":"(B),(D),(A),(C)"},{"id":"C","text":"(B), (A), (C), (D)"},{"id":"D","text":"(C), (A), (D), (B)"}]', 0, 'D', 'Although most of the letters in our DNA are identical, there are a common broad template, and also a lot of person-specific changes in them, due to which someone is prone to certain diseases or has a particular hair color.

C $ \rightarrow $ introduces contrast: DNA letters mostly identical.

A $ \rightarrow $ states main idea: common broad template.

D $ \rightarrow $ adds detail: person-specific changes.

B $ \rightarrow $ concludes effect: susceptibility to diseases or hair color.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[32]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.614Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (387, 'english-2025-05-20-shift-2', 'q23', 23, 23, 'Rearrange the following parts into a meaningful sentence:

(A) the writer lived and worked

(B) lack of substantial evidence

(C) the exact period in which

(D) cannot be ascertained due to', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A), (C), (B), (D)"},{"id":"B","text":"(C), (D), (B), (A)"},{"id":"C","text":"(C),(A),(D),(B)"},{"id":"D","text":"(A), (B), (D), (C)"}]', 0, 'C', '"The exact period in which the writer lived and worked cannot be ascertained due to lack of substantial evidence."

C $ \rightarrow $ introduces head noun phrase: "The exact period in which…"

A $ \rightarrow $ completes relative clause: "the writer lived and worked."

D $ \rightarrow $ main predicate: "cannot be ascertained due to …"

B $ \rightarrow $ provides reason: "lack of substantial evidence."', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[33]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.614Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
