The company''s growth was _ by the adverse change in the market regulations.', '[{"id":"A","text":"augmented"},{"id":"B","text":"facilitated"},{"id":"C","text":"propelled"},{"id":"D","text":"hindered"}]', 0, 'D', 'Hindered : obstructed or slowed growth; fits negative impact of regulation.

