(A) role in scavenging dead organic materials and diseased

(B) population as well as aquatic plants and weeds

(C) according to environmentalists, the turtle plays a significant

(D) fish in the river, thereby controlling the fish', '[{"id":"A","text":"(B), (D), (A), (C)"},{"id":"B","text":"(A), (B), (C), (D)"},{"id":"C","text":"(C), (A), (D), (B)"},{"id":"D","text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)"}]', 0, 'C', 'According to environmentalists, the turtle plays a significant role in scavenging dead organic materials and diseased fish in the river; thereby controlling the fish population as well as aquatic plants and weeds.

