Correct Answer: 1. $ 20^{\circ} $', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[18]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.640Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (476, 'general-test-2025-05-20-shift-2', 'q18', 14, 14, 'Which of the following will show "Tyndall Effect"?

(A) Mixture of water and milk

(B) Sunlight passing through a canopy of dense forest

(C) Solution of copper sulphate

(D) Light entering a smoke-filled room through a small hole', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A), (B) and (C) only"},{"id":"B","text":"(A), (B) and (D) only"},{"id":"C","text":"(A), (C) and (D) only"},{"id":"D","text":"(B), (C) and (D) only"}]', 0, 'B', 'Tyndall Effect:

It is the scattering of light by colloidal particles.

Check options:

• (A) Water + milk → colloid → shows Tyndall effect

• (B) Sunlight in dense forest $ \rightarrow $ dust particles scatter light

• (C) Copper sulphate solution → true solution → no scattering ✗

• (D) Smoke-filled room → colloidal particles → scattering

Correct Answer: 2. (A), (B) and (D) only', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[18]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.640Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
