Change in population: 700-200+300-100=700 ( immigration is people coming in and emigration is people moving out )', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[17]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.677Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
