(A) Earliest temples

(B) Early Upanishads

(C) First stupas

(D) Vedic traditions', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A), (B), (C), (D)"},{"id":"B","text":"(D), (B), (C), (A)"},{"id":"C","text":"(B), (A), (D), (C)"},{"id":"D","text":"(C), (B), (D), (A)"}]', 0, 'B', 'The correct sequence is 2. (D),(B),(C),(A) because :

(D) Vedic traditions - c. 1500-1000 BCE

