(A) The Harappan seal is possibly the most distinctive artefact of Harappan or Indus Valley civilization.

(B) Seals and sealing were used to facilitate long-distance communication.

(C) Harappan seals usually have a line of writing, probably containing the name and title of the owner.

(D) The sealing also conveyed the identity of the sender.', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A), (B) and (D) only"},{"id":"B","text":"(A), (B) and (C) only"},{"id":"C","text":"(A), (B), (C) and (D)"},{"id":"D","text":"(B), (C) and (D) only"}]', 0, 'C', 'All the statements are correct.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[6]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.776Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (747, 'history-2025-06-03-shift-2', 'q09', 8, 8, 'In some Harappan seals, a figure is shown seated cross-legged in a yogic posture, sometimes surrounded by animals. It has been regarded as a depiction of:', '[{"id":"A","text":"Proto Shiva"},{"id":"B","text":"Proto Vishnu"},{"id":"C","text":"Proto Rudra"},{"id":"D","text":"Proto Prithvi"}]', 0, 'A', 'A figure depicted seated cross-legged in a "yogic" posture, often surrounded by animals, is believed to represent Proto-Shiva-an early form of one of Hinduism''s major deities.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[6]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.776Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (748, 'history-2025-06-03-shift-2', 'q10', 9, 9, 'Who is known as the ''best ruler'' of the Satavahana dynasty?', '[{"id":"A","text":"Gotami-Puta-Siri-Gupta"},{"id":"B","text":"Gotami-Putra-Siri-Kama"},{"id":"C","text":"Gotami-Puta-Siri-Satakarni"},{"id":"D","text":"Gotami-Puta-Siri-Satnami"}]', 0, 'C', 'The best-known ruler of the Satavahana dynasty, Gotami-puta Siri-Satakani, described himself as both a unique Brahmana (eka bamhana) and a destroyer of the pride of Kshatriyas.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[7]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.777Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (749, 'history-2025-06-03-shift-2', 'q11', 10, 10, 'Which traveller gives a description on ''widespread poverty'' of the early decades in the 17th century?', '[{"id":"A","text":"Pelsaert"},{"id":"B","text":"Peter Mundy"},{"id":"C","text":"Seydi Ali Reis"},{"id":"D","text":"Mahmud Wali Balkhi"}]', 0, 'A', 'Pelsaert, a Dutch traveller of the early seventeenth century, was struck by the severe poverty in the Indian subcontinent. He described it as a land of "stark want and bitter woe."', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[8]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:38.777Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
