Deforestation reduces $ \underline{\text{nesting}} $ sites', '[{"id":"A","text":"building"},{"id":"B","text":"sheltering"},{"id":"C","text":"reproducing"},{"id":"D","text":"protecting"}]', 0, 'B', 'The correct answer is ''sheltering''.

