To give a book a _ reading is to skim it quickly without comprehending much.', '[{"id":"A","text":"cursory"},{"id":"B","text":"cryptic"},{"id":"C","text":"morose"},{"id":"D","text":"munificent"}]', 0, 'A', 'The correct answer is ''cursory''.
