Kalyani made her children _ chores on Sunday.', '[{"id":"A","text":"make some"},{"id":"B","text":"take some"},{"id":"C","text":"do some"},{"id":"D","text":"does some"}]', 0, 'C', 'The correct answer is ''do some''.
Key Points

