Thus, the final series is :

Hence," Option 2"is the correct answer.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[{"id":"q37-figure-1","kind":"figure","path":"/local-papers/assets/general-test-2024-05-15-shift-3/q37-figure-1.jpg","page":44,"alt":"Figure for question 37"},{"id":"q37-options","kind":"options","path":"/local-papers/assets/general-test-2024-05-15-shift-3/q37-options.jpg","page":44,"alt":"Printed answer choices for question 37"}]', '[44]', 'keyed', '["image-options"]', '2026-11-05T20:58:44.400Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
