$$ =a^{2}+b^{3}+c^{4}. $$', '[{"id":"A","text":"420"},{"id":"B","text":"92"},{"id":"C","text":"602"},{"id":"D","text":"456"}]', 0, 'D', 'The Logic followed here is,

