Identify the labels A, B and C in the given figure', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A) HI (B) DNA (C) Histone histone octamer"},{"id":"B","text":"(A) DNA (B) HI (C) Histone histone octamer"},{"id":"C","text":"(A) Histone (B) DNA (C) HIO octamer histone"},{"id":"D","text":"(A) DNA (B) Histone (C) HI octamer histone"}]', 0, 'B', 'A is DNA, B is H1 histone and C is histone octamer.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[{"id":"q44-figure-1","kind":"figure","path":"/local-papers/assets/biology-2023-06-05-shift-3/q44-figure-1.jpg","page":5,"alt":"Figure for question 44"}]', '[5]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:51.523Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
