"The ideal reader steps up to the plate of the writers style so that together writer and reader might hit the ball out of the park."', '[{"id":"A","text":"the ideal reader encourages the writer to improve his style."},{"id":"B","text":"the ideal reader makes every effort to outshine the writer"},{"id":"C","text":"the average reader proves himself superior to the writer"},{"id":"D","text":"the average reader makes enhanced efforts to understand the writer''s style so that they can achieve outstanding success together"}]', 0, 'D', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[2]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.405Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
