Given set: (265, 392, 285)', '[{"id":"A","text":"(373, 472, 366)"},{"id":"B","text":"(343, 482, 360)"},{"id":"C","text":"(363, 482, 361)"},{"id":"D","text":"(373, 482, 366)"}]', 0, 'D', '265 = 2 + 6 + 5 = 13

392 = 3 + 9 + 2 = 14

285 = 2 + 8 + 5 = 15.

