e enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se enquanto não se en meistern was"}]', 0, 'C', 'For protoplast fusion, the two cells of desired plants are first treated with enzymes pectinase and cellulase. These enzymes dissolve the cell wall and as a result naked protoplasts are produced.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[4]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.528Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3667, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q01', 1, 1, 'Arrange the following options in a sequential manner to demonstrate degradation caused by improper resource utilisation and maintenance.

A. Barren patches of land that become large and lead to desertification

B. Fertile top soil can be removed easily by over cultivation

C. Deposition of thin crust of salt on land surface

D. Unrestricted grazing of animals

E. Irrigation without proper drainage of water leading to water logging in the soil', '[{"id":"A","text":"A, B, C, D, E"},{"id":"B","text":"C, D, A, B, E"},{"id":"C","text":"B, D, E, C, A"},{"id":"D","text":"E, D, B, C, A"}]', 0, 'C', 'The fertile top-soil can be removed very easily due to human activities like over-cultivation, unrestricted grazing, deforestation and poor irrigation practices, resulting in arid patches of land.

When large barren patches extend and meet over time, a desert is created. Hence, option C is correct.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.530Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3668, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q02', 2, 2, 'Match List I with List II', '[{"id":"A","text":"A-IV, B-I, C-II, D-III"},{"id":"B","text":"A-III, B-IV, C-I, D-II"},{"id":"C","text":"A-1, B-II, C-IV, D-III"},{"id":"D","text":"A-II, B-III, C-I, D-IV"}]', 0, 'B', 'Fertilization (fusion of egg and sperm) takes place at ampulla of the female reproductive tract. Fimbriae are finger-like projections on the ends of your fallopian tubes closest to your ovaries. The clitoris is part of the vulva, the name for the external parts of female genitalia.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[{"id":"q02-table-1","kind":"table","path":"/local-papers/assets/biology-2022-08-20/q02-table-1.jpg","page":1,"alt":"Table for question 2"}]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.530Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3669, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q03', 3, 3, 'Mucosa associated lymphoid tissue constitutes', '[{"id":"A","text":"10%"},{"id":"B","text":"20%"},{"id":"C","text":"40%"},{"id":"D","text":"50%"}]', 0, 'D', 'Mucosa-associated lymphoid tissue (MALT) are lymphoid tissues found in various submucosal membrane sites of the body, such as the gastrointestinal tract, oral passage, nasopharyngeal tract, thyroid, breast, lung, salivary glands, eye, and skin. MALT constitutes about 50% of the lymphoid tissue in the human body.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.530Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3670, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q04', 4, 4, 'Which of the following is INCORRECT statement?

A. In IUD''s, released Cu ions increases sperm motility and fertilising capacity of sperms

B. Multiload 375 is medicated IUD

C. Lippes loop is non-medicated IUD

D. LNG-20 is hormones releasing IUD

E. Vault is an IUD.', '[{"id":"A","text":"A & E only"},{"id":"B","text":"A & B only"},{"id":"C","text":"B & D only"},{"id":"D","text":"B & C only"}]', 0, 'A', 'Two are incorrect statement:

i. Copper releasing IUDs decrease sperm motility and fertilising capacity of sperm.

ii. Vault is a barrier method of contraception.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.531Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3671, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q05', 5, 5, 'Which of the following is not a vegetation propagation?', '[{"id":"A","text":"Runner of grass"},{"id":"B","text":"Offset of water hyacinth"},{"id":"C","text":"Rhizome of Ginger"},{"id":"D","text":"Bud of Hydra"}]', 0, 'D', 'In plants, the units of vegetative propagation are runner, rhizome, sucker, tuber, offset, bulb etc. They are capable of giving rise to new offspring.

Buds in Hydra are asexual reproductive structures. They are do not involved in vegetative propagation.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.531Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3672, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q06', 6, 6, 'Select the correct sequence of development of following stages in a primary succession

A. Scrub Stage

B. Marsh-meadow stage

C. Submerged free floating plant stage

D. Reed-swamp stage

E. Submerged plant stage', '[{"id":"A","text":"C, E, B, D, A"},{"id":"B","text":"E, C, D, B, A"},{"id":"C","text":"D, E, B, C, A"},{"id":"D","text":"E, C, D, A, B"}]', 0, 'B', 'The primary succession in water involved following step: the pioneers are replaced with time by rooted-submerged plants, rooted-floating angiosperms followed by free-floating plants, then reed-swamp, marsh-meadow, scrub and finally the trees.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.532Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3673, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q07', 7, 7, 'Which of the following process involves the theory of antigen-antibody interaction?', '[{"id":"A","text":"PCR"},{"id":"B","text":"ELISA"},{"id":"C","text":"Gene Therapy"},{"id":"D","text":"Gel electrophoresis"}]', 0, 'B', 'The most common application of antigen-antibody reactions is in diagnostics using an enzyme-linked immunosorbent assay (ELISA).', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.532Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3674, 'biology-2022-08-20', 'q08', 8, 8, 'Following are the animals that recently became extinct, except', '[{"id":"A","text":"Dodo"},{"id":"B","text":"Quagga"},{"id":"C","text":"Thylacine"},{"id":"D","text":"Clarias garipinus"}]', 0, 'D', 'Examples of recent extinctions of species include the dodo from Mauritius, quagga from Africa, thylacine from Australia and Steller''s Sea Cow from Russia whereas Clarias garipinus is not extinct till now.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.532Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
