Statement 1: Baculoviruses belonging to genus Nucleopolyhedrovirus are used as biological control agent.

Statement 2: These viruses are used as they are species-specific and have narrow spectrum insecticidal applications, so can be a good insecticide.

In the light of above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below', '[{"id":"A","text":"Both statement 1 and statement 2 are correct"},{"id":"B","text":"Both statement 1 and statement 2 are incorrect"},{"id":"C","text":"Statement 1 is correct and statement 2 is incorrect"},{"id":"D","text":"Statement 1 is incorrect and statement 2 is correct"}]', 0, 'A', 'Both the statements are correct.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.532Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
