B. Hydrogen is evolved at cathode

C. Oxygen is evolved at anode

D. Oxygen is evolved at cathode

E. Chlorine is evolved at anode', '[{"id":"A","text":"B, E only"},{"id":"B","text":"A, E only"},{"id":"C","text":"B, D only"},{"id":"D","text":"B, C only"}]', 0, 'A', 'NaCl(aq) $ \longrightarrow $ Na $ ^{+} $(aq) + Cl $ ^{-} $(aq)

