B. $\mathrm{PbO}_{2}$ acts as anode

C. $\mathrm{H}_{2}\mathrm{SO}_{4}$ is produced

D. $38\% \mathrm{NH}_{4} \mathrm{Cl}$ is used as electrolyte

E. Lead storage cell has a longer life than nickel cadmium cell', '[{"id":"A","text":"A only"},{"id":"B","text":"B only"},{"id":"C","text":"C only"},{"id":"D","text":"D, E only"}]', 0, 'C', 'Net reaction:

$ 2\text{PbSO}_{4}(s) + 2\text{H}_{2}\text{O}(l) \rightarrow \text{Pb}(s) + \text{PbO}_{2}(s) + 2\text{H}_{2}\text{SO}_{4}(aq) $

38% H_{2}SO_{4} solution is used as electrolyte.

Nickel-cadmium cell has longer life than lead-storage cell.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.572Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (3858, 'chemistry-2022-08-18', 'q06', 6, 6, 'Molar conductivity of _ increases drastically on dilution.', '[{"id":"A","text":"$ \\mathrm{NH}_{4}\\mathrm{Cl} $"},{"id":"B","text":"NaCl"},{"id":"C","text":"$ \\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\mathrm{COOH} $"},{"id":"D","text":"$ \\mathrm{CH}_{3}\\mathrm{COONa} $"}]', 0, 'C', 'Molar conductivity of weak electrolyte increases on dilution because of increase in number of ions.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.572Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
