ii. Syntax: Dataframe. append (other, ignore-index=False, verify-integrity = false, sort = none)

In the above syntax, one of the parameter is ''sort'' which is used to sort columns in order.

iv. The default sorting is deprecated and will chnage to not-sorting in a future version of pondas. explicitly pass "sort = True" to silence the warning and sort.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[2]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.590Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
