Correct sequence: Neither the earthquake nor the subsequent fire could dampen the spirit of residents.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[3]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.619Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
