D. Reject

List II (Meaning)

A. To put a limit

B. To feel or show great happiness

C. Refrain

D. Reject

III. Dismiss as inadequate

IV. Stop oneself from doing something', '[{"id":"A","text":"A-II, B-I, C-IV, D-III"},{"id":"B","text":"A-I, B-II, C-III, D-IV"},{"id":"C","text":"A-I, B-II, C-IV, D-III"},{"id":"D","text":"A-II, B-IV, C-I, D-III"}]', 0, 'C', 'Option (c) is apt here.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[5]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.627Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
