(A) OZ (B) KL (C) PK (D) DL Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', '[{"id":"A","text":"(IV)"},{"id":"B","text":"(III)"},{"id":"C","text":"(IV)"},{"id":"D","text":"(I) (A) B C D (II) (I) (II) (III) (IV) (V) (I) (II) (III) (A) (II) (III) (IV) (V) (B) (I) (II) (III) (V) (C) (I) (II) (III) (V) (D) (I) (II) (III) (V) (A) (II) (III) (IV) (V) (B) (I) (II) (III) (V) (C) (I) (II) (III) (V) (D) (I) (II) (III) (V)"}]', 0, 'C', 'The pattern is:

$ \mathrm{O}(15) + \mathrm{Z}(26) = 41 - (\mathrm{iv}) $

$ \mathrm{K}(11) + \mathrm{L}(12) = 23 - (\mathrm{i}) $

$ \mathrm{P}(16) + \mathrm{K}(11) = 27 - (\mathrm{ii}) $

$ \mathrm{D}(4) + \mathrm{L}(12) = 16 - (\mathrm{iii}) $

Hence, Kalam is maternal Uncle of Ravi.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[2]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.633Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
