Face I - 1

Face IV - 2

Face III - 3

Face II - 4

Face V - 5

Face VI - 6

Therefore, 1 appears opposite to 3.

Hence, when 3 is at the top, then 1 will be at the bottom.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[{"id":"q23-figure-1","kind":"figure","path":"/local-papers/assets/general-test-2022-08-08-shift-1/q23-figure-1.jpg","page":3,"alt":"Figure for question 23"}]', '[3]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:58:59.641Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
