61. The Greek ambassador sent to Chandragupta Maurya''s Court was:', '[{"id":"A","text":"Kautilya"},{"id":"B","text":"Seleucus Nicator"},{"id":"C","text":"Megasthenes"},{"id":"D","text":"Justin"}]', 0, 'B', 'Shivaji used cannons and ammunition from the Portuguese to attack the English. Chhatrapati Shivaji was the famous Maratha king who had the utmost courage to stand against the vast ocean of Mughal rule, single-handedly.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[4]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:59:06.872Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
