Mohan wants to donate a rectangular plot of land for a hospital in his village. When he was asked to give dimensions of the plot, he told that if its length (x) is decreased by 50 m and breadth (y) is increased by 50 m, then its area will remain same, but if length is decreased by 10 m and breadth is decreased by 20 m, then its area will decrease by 5300 m².

The equations in terms of x and y are:', '[{"id":"A","text":"$x-y=50, 2x+y=550$"},{"id":"B","text":"$x+y=40, 2x-y=550$"},{"id":"C","text":"$x-y=10, 2x+y=50$"},{"id":"D","text":"$x-y=30, 2x+y=505$"}]', 0, 'A', 'Let length and breadth of plot be x and y respectively. Then, $ (x-50)(y+50)=xy $ ...(i) and, $ (x-10)(y-20)=xy-5300 $ ...(ii) From (i), $ 50x-50y-2500=0 $ $ \Rightarrow x-y=50 $ From (ii), $ -20x-10y+200=-5300 $ $ \Rightarrow 20x+10y=5500 $ $ \Rightarrow 2x+y=550 $', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[4]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:59:06.945Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
