The actress wore a dark ___ to hide her face, but she could not suppress a loud ___ of grief when she saw the ___ state of the slum.', '[{"id":"A","text":"vail, wail, vile"},{"id":"B","text":"veil, vail, vile"},{"id":"C","text":"veil, wail, vile"},{"id":"D","text":"vile, wail, veil"}]', 0, 'C', 'Step 1: Fill the first blank.

