which stands for:

### United Nations Development Programme

#### Step 3:

Other organizations have different functions:

• World Bank – development finance.

• IMF – monetary stability.

• WTO – international trade regulation.

Hence,

Option (B)

Quick Tip: HDI and Human Development Report are always associated with UNDP.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:59:13.012Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
