Step 1: Identify Milpa region.

Milpa is the local name of shifting cultivation in:

Central America/Mexico

Thus:

 $$ A\to2 $$ 

Step 2: Identify Jhumming region.

Jhumming or Jhum cultivation is practiced mainly in:

Northeast India

Thus:

 $$ B\to1 $$ 

Step 3: Identify Ladang region.

Ladang is practiced in:

Indonesia/Malaysia

Thus:

 $$ c\to4 $$ 

Step 4: Identify Ray region.

Ray is the local name used in:

Vietnam

Thus:

 $$ D\to3 $$ 

Step 5: Write the final matching.

 $$ \begin{array}{l}A-2,B-1,C-4,D-3\end{array} $$ 

Step 6: Conclusion.

Hence, the correct answer is:

 $$ \left|\begin{array}{l}A-2,B-1,C-4,D-3\end{array}\right. $$ 

Quick Tip: Shifting cultivation is known by many regional names such as Jhum, Milpa, Ladang and Ray.', NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'keyed', '[]', '2026-11-05T20:59:13.020Z', NULL, NULL, 'ai_draft', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO practice_questions ("id", "paper_slug", "question_key", "source_question_no", "position", "stem", "options_json", "options_are_images", "correct_option", "explanation", "passage_key", "match_list_json", "arrangement_json", "assets_json", "source_pages_json", "review_status", "review_flags_json", "created_at", "updated_at", "deleted_at", "explanation_source", "explanation_status", "reviewed_by", "reviewed_at") VALUES (5866, 'geography-2026-05-11-shift-1', 'q10', 9, 9, 'Statement I: Mediterranean agriculture is highly specialized commercial agriculture.

Statement II: Viticulture (grape cultivation) is a specialty of the Mediterranean region.

Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', '[{"id":"A","text":"Statement I is the cause of Statement II."},{"id":"B","text":"Both statements are correct and II explains I."},{"id":"C","text":"Both statements are correct but II does not explain I."},{"id":"D","text":"Statement II is incorrect."}]', 0, 'B', 'Concept:

Mediterranean agriculture is a commercial farming system characterized by specialized crop

cultivation.

