Marco Polo was a well-known merchant traveller from:

Italy

He visited India during the medieval period and wrote detailed travel accounts.

Therefore:

 $$ B\to III $$ 

Step 3: Identifying François Bernier.

François Bernier was a French traveller and physician who visited India during the Mughal period.

Therefore:

 $$ C\to I $$ 

Step 4: Writing the final matching.

Thus:

 $$ A-II,B-III,C-I $$ 

