m s². Then the magnitude of the acceleration of a proton under the action of same force is nearly', '[{"id":"A","text":"1.6 × 10¹ m s²"},{"id":"B","text":"9.1 × 10³¹ m s²"},{"id":"C","text":"1.5 × 10¹ m s²"},{"id":"D","text":"1.6 × 10² m s²"}]', 0, 'C', 'Step 1: Understanding the Concept:
