r 60,000 shares. The Directors allotted the shares to all applicants on pro-rata basis. All money received except call on 1,000 shares issued to Ravi"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:20.016Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
