## Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A)-(I), (B)-(II), (C)-(III), (D)-(IV)"},{"id":"B","text":"(A)-(I), (B)-(III), (C)-(II), (D)-(IV)"},{"id":"C","text":"(A)-(I), (B)-(II), (C)-(IV), (D)-(III)"},{"id":"D","text":"(A)-(III),(B)-(IV),(C)-(I),(D)-(II)"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[7]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["contains_table_data","missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:20.037Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
