application money received is more than the amount due on allotment of shares, such excess amount may either be:', '[{"id":"A","text":"Adjusted towards the amount due on the allotment of shares allotted"},{"id":"B","text":"Refunded or credited to calls in advance"},{"id":"C","text":"Refunded money in full"},{"id":"D","text":"Refunded or credited to Calls in Arrears"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[44]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:20.055Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
