<table border=1 style=''margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;''><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>List-I (Movement of Ratios)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>List-II (Type of Ratio)</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>A. Measure of liquidity</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>IV. Current ratio</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>B. Measure of earning capacity</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>III. Profitability ratio</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>C. Measure of activity of firm&#x27;s inventory</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>II. Inventory turnover ratio</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>D. Measure of productive efficiency of funds</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>I. Return on capital employed</td></tr></table>

Choose the correct answer from the options given below:

1.', '[{"id":"A","text":"-(I V)"},{"id":"B","text":"-(I I)"},{"id":"C","text":"-(I I I)"},{"id":"D","text":"-(1) 2. (A) - (IV), (B) - (III), (C) - (II), (D) - (I) 3. (A)-(IV),(B)-(II),(C)-(I),(D)-(III) 4. (A)-(I),(B)-(II),(C)-(III),(D)-(IV) Options: Answer: B"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[50]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["contains_table_data","missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:20.055Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
