ase customer base. In order to develop goodwill, the company also decided to print the list of ingredients outside the package to inform the customers about product contents. The marketing executive also came up a plan to provide gifts to customer who buy in bulk e.g., 2 soups free with 01 large pizza, 01 pasta free with 02 medium pizzas"}]', 0, 'C', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:20.072Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
