Manorama Retail is a rapidly expanding retail company with stores across multiple cities. As the company grows, managing the workforce becomes increasingly complex. The HR department of XYZ faces several challenges, including hiring the right talent, managing employee turnover, and creating a training and development program to upskill employees.

The company’s recruitment process involves several stages, including screening resumes, conducting interviews, and background checks. However, finding

