(A) Ex Ante Saving represents what is actually planned to save.

(B) Ex Post Saving represents what is actually planned to save.

(C) Ex Post Saving depicts what has actually happened.

(D) Ex Ante Post Saving represents what is actually saved.

Choose the correct answer from the options given below :', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A) and (D) only"},{"id":"B","text":"(A) and (C) only"},{"id":"C","text":"(B) and (D) only"},{"id":"D","text":"(C) and (D) only"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[1]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:25.007Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
