Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', '[{"id":"A","text":"(A), (C) and (D) only"},{"id":"B","text":"(A), (B) and (D) only"},{"id":"C","text":"(A), (B), (C) and (D) only"},{"id":"D","text":"(B), (C) and (D) only"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[40]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:25.038Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
