Choose the correct answer from the options given below:', '[{"id":"A","text":"(E), (B), (A), (D), (C)"},{"id":"B","text":"(B), (C), (A), (D), (E)"},{"id":"C","text":"(A), (B), (C), (E), (D)"},{"id":"D","text":"(C), (D), (B), (A), (E)"}]', 0, 'B', NULL, NULL, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[39,40]', 'verified_against_ocr', '["missing_explanation"]', '2026-11-05T20:59:25.153Z', NULL, NULL, 'none', 'unreviewed', NULL, NULL);
